data: {"id": "0f2a6ceba66a4d24-thinking-parallel_evidence-680", "run_id": "0f2a6ceba66a4d24", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 状态 (kubectl_describe & Events)**\n   - Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 处于 `Pending` 状态。\n   - 容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，`Reason: ContainerCreating`。\n   - **根因事件**：Events 中反复出现 `Warning FailedMount`，错误原文为：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。\n   - 该错误已持续约 27 分钟（x21 次），确认并非瞬时网络抖动，而是明确的配置缺失。\n\n2. **Metrics (execute_pod_promql)**\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase` 确认 Pod 为 `Pending` (value=1)。\n   - `kube_pod_container_", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788770178838, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

