data: {"id": "0f2a6ceba66a4d24-final", "run_id": "0f2a6ceba66a4d24", "seq": 685, "ts_ms": 1788770192900, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 定位失败根因：缺失的 ConfigMap 导致挂载无法完成 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`：`timed out waiting for the condition` (x10 over 25m) | 佐证挂载失败导致 Pod 长时间阻塞的客观事实 |\n| 3 | K8s State | pod status | `Pending` (fact-5dc9dbe9ed40) | 确认 Pod 处于阻塞状态，且 `ContainerCreating` 未进入 `Running` |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`: 1, `reason=ContainerCreating` (fact-5903dc48da2a) | 独立观测指标印证容器卡在创建阶段，未发生重启 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | spec | `volumes=[input]` 依赖缺失配置 | 提供触发挂载检查的卷定义上下文 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. 事件与指标双向印证：事件日志明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` 是导致 `FailedMount` 的直接原因；Prometheus 的等待原因指标同步显示为 `ContainerCreating`，排除其他原因（如 OOM、CrashLoopBackOff）导致挂起的可能。\n2. 状态一致性：Pod 状态为 `Pending` 且重启次数为 0，说明故障发生在容器启动前的挂载阶段，未触及容器应用逻辑，因此 Logging 和 Tracing 无数据符合物理逻辑。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → kubelet 尝试挂载卷 'input' 失败 → Pod 阻塞在 MountVolume.SetUp 阶段 → 状态变为 ContainerCreating/Pending\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 Pod 的 `volume 'input'` 引用了一个不存在（名称为 `unavailable-config`）的 ConfigMap。Kubelet 在启动容器前必须验证并挂载所有卷，由于配置对象缺失，挂载操作持续失败并超时，导致 Pod 永远无法进入 `Running` 状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 52.6s\n├─ 问题定位: 21.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 23.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 23.2s (Evidence 17.0s, RCA 6.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 52.55, "metrics": {"run_id": "0f2a6ceba66a4d24", "mttr": {"value": "52.6s", "seconds": 52.55687999725342, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 52556.87999725342, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 49216.1078453064, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7296.188116073608, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2991.473913192749}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 21488.29984664917, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_